From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Slavi Pantaleev <slavi@devture.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Feb 2026 14:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] yaml-cpp: include cstdint in emitterutils

Recent GCC/libstdc++ combinations do not expose fixed-width integer types
transitively for this file, which causes uint16_t/uint32_t build failures.
Add the direct include.
---
 src/emitterutils.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/emitterutils.cpp b/src/emitterutils.cpp
index 108f580..90d50f6 100644
--- a/src/emitterutils.cpp
+++ b/src/emitterutils.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <iomanip>
 #include <sstream>
--
2.48.1
